msgstr "指定した秒数だけスリープします。"

#: of pwnlib.shellcraft.aarch64.linux.sleep:3
#: pwnlib.shellcraft.amd64.linux.sleep:3 pwnlib.shellcraft.arm.linux.sleep:3
#: pwnlib.shellcraft.i386.linux.sleep:3 pwnlib.shellcraft.mips.linux.sleep:3
#: pwnlib.shellcraft.riscv64.linux.sleep:3
#: pwnlib.shellcraft.thumb.linux.sleep:3
msgid "Uses SYS_nanosleep under the hood. Doesn't check for interrupts and doesn't retry with the remaining time."
msgstr "内部では SYS_nanosleep を使います。割り込みの確認はせず、残り時間での再試行もしません。"

#: of pwnlib.shellcraft.aarch64.linux.sleep:6
#: pwnlib.shellcraft.amd64.linux.sleep:6 pwnlib.shellcraft.arm.linux.sleep:6
#: pwnlib.shellcraft.i386.linux.sleep:6 pwnlib.shellcraft.mips.linux.sleep:6
#: pwnlib.shellcraft.riscv64.linux.sleep:6
#: pwnlib.shellcraft.thumb.linux.sleep:6
